{{disambig msg|the enemy|the item|The Mulligan}}

'''Mulligans''' are enemies that will actively try to avoid Isaac; their eyes widen and their speed increases when doing so. When running away, they may walk over spikes or into a fire.

Upon death, they spawn several {{e|Fly|text=Flies}}, {{e|Attack Fly|text=Attack Flies}} and, occasionally, a {{e|Pooter}}. Mulligans may sometimes self-detonate. If this occurs: in addition to spawning flies as normal, it will also fire four projectiles in the cardinal directions and destroy nearby objects when doing so. Mulligans cannot deal contact damage to Isaac ({{dlc|na+}} unless they are [[Champion]]s).

Alternatively, if a Mulligan's health is dropped to -10 or less in one instance (i.e., by using a Bomb), it will spawn nothing on death.

