 | base hp     = 60
 | environment = {{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Alternating between walking towards and running away from Isaac. Releases a Leper Flesh each time it takes enough damage. At low health, constantly chases Isaac and leaves behind damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|red creep]]. Spawns a Leper Flesh and {{E|Gusher}} upon death.
