'''Lepers''' are a Mulligan variant that alternate between walking towards and running away from Isaac. For every 15 damage they take, a chunk of their head, known as a Leper Flesh, will detach and start erratically chasing Isaac. Lepers deal contact damage if they are in this state or below. Lepers can naturally be found with some head chunks missing.

After being reduced to 15 health, Lepers will chase Isaac continuously, leaving a trail of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]]. Upon death, they leave behind one Leper Flesh and have a 50% chance to leave behind a Grey-colored {{e|Gusher}}.

Alternatively, if a Leper's health is dropped to -25 or less in one instance (i.e., by using a Bomb), it will never spawn a Gusher on death, but will still spawn Leper Flesh.
{{clear}}

